   "tag": "Stop 1",
   "h2": "Cardiac output worked",
   "body_html": "<p class=\"big\">CO = <span class=\"hl p\">HR × SV</span>.</p><p>72 bpm × 70 ml = 5040 ml/min ≈ <b>5 L/min</b>. Exercise raises both — CO can reach 25 L/min in athletes.</p>"
  },
  {
   "tag": "Stop 2",
   "h2": "SA:V calculation",
   "body_html": "<p>For a cube of side L: SA = 6L², V = L³, SA:V = 6 ÷ L.</p><p>Side 3 cm → 6 ÷ 3 = <span class=\"hl e\">2 :1</span>. Side 6 cm → 6 ÷ 6 = 1:1.</p>"
  },
  {
   "tag": "Stop 3",
   "h2": "Minute ventilation",
   "body_html": "<p>Minute ventilation = tidal volume × breathing rate.</p><p>0.5 dm³ × 16 = <b>8 dm³/min</b> at rest.</p>"
  }
